                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#878787' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='7'>• &apos;SSU &amp; W2L SHARE&apos; ONlY CONSIDERS COUNTRIES WITH SSU OR W2L</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
