                    <run fontcolor='#878787' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='7'>• DEFAULT VIEW DOESNT INCLUDE WOOWA, DH GREECE, INSTASHOP </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#878787' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='7'>   &amp; CARRIAGE ENTITIES</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#878787' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='7'>• PRODUCTIVITY ONLY CONSIDERS ACQUISITIONS FROM FTES</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#878787' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='7'>• GRADING:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#878787' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='7'>  - &apos;AB&apos; REFERES TO &apos;A&apos; OR &apos;B&apos; GRADED VENDORS (BEFORE ACQUISITION)</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#878787' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='7'>  - &apos;AB NEW ONLINE %&apos; ONlY CONSIDERS COUNTRIES WITH GRADING</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#878787' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='7'>• &apos;SSU &amp; W2L SHARE&apos; ONlY CONSIDERS COUNTRIES WITH SSU OR W2L</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#878787' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='7'>• TARGETS ARE SET AT COUNTRY LEVEL AND THEN AGGRATED</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#878787' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='7'>• FOR FURTHER DEEPDIVE YOU MAY USE THE SUMMARY TAB</run>
