                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='2400' id='45' type-v2='text' w='24308' x='6230' y='10912'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#878787' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='7'>• DEFAULT VIEW DOESNT INCLUDE WOOWA, CARRIAGE NOR INSTASHOP </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#878787' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='7'>• ONLY CONSIDERS OWN DELIVERY</run>
